{"id":"c7defb37-6e44-46c1-a31b-3b6e456f152f","object":"chat.completion","created":1794558317,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  :root{\n    --bg:#F5F2E9;\n    --surface:#F3F0E7;\n    --ink:#1B2620;\n    --muted:#5C665D;\n    --primary:#4F5E43;\n    --secondary:#B4914A;\n    --tertiary:#8C9FB2;\n    --line:#A3AC9E;\n    --font-body:\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,\"PingFang SC\",\"Hiragino Sans GB\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;\n    --font-serif:Georgia,\"Songti SC\",\"STSong\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n  }\n  .slide{\n    position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;\n    background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);\n    font-family:var(--font-body);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- background field ---------- */\n  .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%, rgba(180,145,74,.10), transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(900px 760px at 48% 52%, rgba(140,159,178,.10), transparent 70%),\n      radial-gradient(980px 780px at 96% 98%, rgba(79,94,67,.11), transparent 72%),\n      linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);\n  }\n  .bg:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(27,38,32,.045) 0 1px, transparent 1px 160px);\n    opacity:.9;\n  }\n  .gline{position:absolute;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.05);z-index:1;}\n  .g1{left:480px}.g2{left:960px}.g3{left:1440px}\n\n  .dots{position:absolute;z-index:1;opacity:.28;\n    background-image:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px, transparent 1.15px);\n    background-size:15px 15px;\n  }\n  .dots-a{left:1180px;top:880px;width:700px;height:180px;}\n  .dots-b{left:96px;top:40px;width:180px;height:60px;opacity:.16}\n\n  .register{position:absolute;right:-104px;top:-124px;width:330px;height:330px;z-index:2;\n    border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.30);}\n  .register .r2{position:absolute;inset:12px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);}\n  .register .r3{position:absolute;inset:30px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.10);\n    background:conic-gradient(from 210deg, rgba(79,94,67,.18), rgba(79,94,67,0) 26%, rgba(140,159,178,.28) 52%, rgba(140,159,178,.06) 80%, rgba(79,94,67,.18));}\n  .register .r4{position:absolute;inset:44px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,242,233,.90);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08);}\n  .register .dot{position:absolute;left:36px;bottom:104px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--secondary);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(180,145,74,.13);}\n\n  /* ---------- chrome ---------- */\n  .top-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:48px;width:1760px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.32);z-index:6;}\n  .top-meta{position:absolute;left:96px;top:62px;z-index:7;\n    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4.2px;color:#4f5b53;}\n  .top-meta-r{position:absolute;right:96px;top:62px;z-index:7;\n    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3.4px;color:#6b766c;}\n\n  .foot-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:966px;width:1760px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.18);z-index:6;}\n  .foot-left{position:absolute;left:96px;top:982px;z-index:7;\n    font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2.6px;color:#6b766c;}\n  .page-no{position:absolute;right:96px;top:978px;z-index:7;\n    font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.4px;color:#4f5b53;}\n\n  /* ---------- title ---------- */\n  .eyebrow{position:absolute;left:98px;top:110px;z-index:8;\n    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:5px;color:#7c867d;}\n  .eyebrow .bar{display:inline-block;width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--secondary);\n    vertical-align:middle;margin-right:16px;transform:translateY(-2px);}\n  h1{position:absolute;left:96px;top:146px;width:1450px;margin:0;z-index:8;\n    font-family:var(--font-serif);font-weight:700;font-size:84px;line-height:1.14;\n    letter-spacing:1px;color:#1B2620;}\n  .h-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:320px;width:1760px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.26);z-index:8;}\n  .h-accent{position:absolute;left:96px;top:318px;width:132px;height:3px;background:var(--secondary);z-index:9;}\n  .lede{position:absolute;left:96px;top:342px;width:1150px;z-index:8;\n    font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--muted);}\n\n  /* ---------- flow ---------- */\n  .sec-label{position:absolute;z-index:8;\n    font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4.6px;color:#7c867d;}\n  .sec-label .idx{color:var(--secondary);margin-right:14px;}\n  .sl-flow{left:96px;top:412px;}\n  .flow{position:absolute;left:96px;top:448px;width:1760px;height:186px;\n    display:flex;align-items:stretch;z-index:8;}\n  .step{position:relative;flex:1;background:rgba(243,240,231,.78);\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);padding:24px 28px 22px;\n    display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;}\n  .step .no{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:16px;letter-spacing:2.6px;\n    font-weight:600;color:var(--secondary);}\n  .step .name{font-size:33px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;line-height:1.2;color:#1B2620;}\n  .step .foot{position:relative;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.14);}\n  .step .foot:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:42px;height:1px;background:var(--primary);}\n  .step.last{background:rgba(79,94,67,.07);border-color:rgba(79,94,67,.34);}\n  .step.last .foot:after{background:var(--secondary);width:64px;}\n  .arrow{width:46px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:0 0 46px;}\n  .arrow i{position:relative;display:block;width:26px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.38);}\n  .arrow i:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:0;top:-3px;width:7px;height:7px;\n    border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.55);border-right:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.55);transform:rotate(45deg);}\n\n  /* ---------- metrics ---------- */\n  .sl-data{left:96px;top:692px;}\n  .metrics{position:absolute;left:96px;top:728px;width:1060px;height:222px;\n    display:flex;gap:40px;z-index:8;}\n  .metric{position:relative;flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.46);\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18);padding:24px 32px 22px;\n    display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;}\n  .metric .m-top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;}\n  .metric .m-tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3.6px;color:#7c867d;}\n  .metric .m-idx{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--secondary);}\n  .metric .m-val{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;}\n  .metric .num{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:94px;line-height:.94;\n    font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-1px;color:var(--primary);}\n  .metric .unit{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;color:#5C665D;letter-spacing:1px;}\n  .metric .m-lab{font-size:23px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#1B2620;}\n  .metric .m-base{height:2px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.12);position:relative;}\n  .metric .m-base:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:2px;width:76px;background:var(--secondary);}\n\n  /* ---------- blank card ---------- */\n  .blank{position:absolute;left:1196px;top:728px;width:660px;height:222px;z-index:8;\n    background:rgba(243,240,231,.62);border:1px dashed rgba(27,38,32,.34);padding:22px 30px 20px;\n    display:flex;flex-direction:column;}\n  .blank .b-head{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3.8px;color:#7c867d;\n    padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.14);}\n  .field{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n    padding:12px 0 11px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(27,38,32,.20);}\n  .field .f-label{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#3d483f;}\n  .field .f-value{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.2px;color:#8a928a;\n    padding:5px 16px;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.20);\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(27,38,32,.055) 0 5px, transparent 5px 10px);}\n  .blank .b-note{margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;\n    letter-spacing:.4px;color:#657066;}\n\n  /* ---------- annotation rail ---------- */\n  .rail-note{position:absolute;left:96px;top:614px;z-index:8;\n    font-size:14px;letter-spacing:2.4px;color:#8a928a;}\n  .rail-note .dotmark{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--secondary);\n    border-radius:50%;margin-right:12px;transform:translateY(-2px);}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gline g1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gline g2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gline g3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dots dots-a\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dots dots-b\"></div>\n  <div class=\"register\">\n    <div class=\"r2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r4\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">长资料覆盖核验</div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta-r\">虚构企业资料治理测评</div>\n\n  <div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"bar\"></span>02　整理流程</div>\n  <h1>整理流程：四环节与中部记录</h1>\n  <div class=\"h-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"h-accent\"></div>\n  <div class=\"lede\">四个环节按资料记载的顺序排列；中部核验记录给出流程节点与复盘会议的计数。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sec-label sl-flow\"><span class=\"idx\">01</span>四个环节</div>\n  <div class=\"flow\">\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"no\">01</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">资料整理</div>\n      <div class=\"foot\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\"><i></i></div>\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"no\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">角色分工</div>\n      <div class=\"foot\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\"><i></i></div>\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"no\">03</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">沟通记录</div>\n      <div class=\"foot\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"arrow\"><i></i></div>\n    <div class=\"step last\">\n      <div class=\"no\">04</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">版本归档</div>\n      <div class=\"foot\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rail-note\"><span class=\"dotmark\"></span>中部核验记录</div>\n\n  <div class=\"sec-label sl-data\"><span class=\"idx\">02</span>中部核验记录</div>\n  <div class=\"metrics\">\n    <div class=\"metric\">\n      <div class=\"m-top\"><span class=\"m-tag\">中部核验</span><span class=\"m-idx\">A</span></div>\n      <div class=\"m-val\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"unit\">个</span></div>\n      <div class=\"m-lab\">流程节点</div>\n      <div class=\"m-base\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"metric\">\n      <div class=\"m-top\"><span class=\"m-tag\">中部核验</span><span class=\"m-idx\">B</span></div>\n      <div class=\"m-val\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"unit\">次</span></div>\n      <div class=\"m-lab\">复盘会议</div>\n      <div class=\"m-base\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"blank\">\n    <div class=\"b-head\">角色与时间 · 留空项</div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <span class=\"f-label\">各环节负责人姓名</span>\n      <span class=\"f-value\">资料未载</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <span class=\"f-label\">各环节时间安排</span>\n      <span class=\"f-value\">资料未载</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"b-note\">资料未记载各环节负责人姓名与时间安排，故留空；不以推测填充。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"foot-left\">长资料覆盖核验 · 全部指标为本次虚构测评构造值</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\">3 / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"让我生成第3页 HTML，采用参考页视觉风格：暖米色纸张背景、橄榄绿/赭金/灰蓝配色、细线网格、右侧环形装饰、衬线标题。内容：四个流程环节（横向流程条，带编号 01-04），中部核验记录卡片（流程节点 13 个、复盘会议 7 次），以及\"资料未载\"留空区块（负责人姓名与时间安排留空）。\n\n不要引用外部字体（禁止外部资源），用系统字体回退：Georgia, serif 与 Helvetica/Arial 等。\n\n布局 1920×1080，标题区左上，正文中左。\n\n设计：\n- 背景 radial gradients + 竖线网格\n- 顶部细线、左上页码/顶部 meta\n- 标题（衬线大字）\"整理流程：四环节与中部记录\"\n- 副标题小字：中部核验记录 · 虚构测评材料\n- 中部：四环节流程 卡片横排，箭头连接\n- 下方两栏：左 —— 中部核验记录 两个大数字卡（13 流程节点 / 7 复盘会议）；右 —— 留空说明（负责人 / 时间安排 待补充 → 但要求\"资料未记载…故留空\"，用\"资料未载 · 留空\"标注）\n\n注意事实边界：不写日期预算。留空项标注\"资料未载\"。\n\n写代码。\n\n尺寸规划：\n- 页面 1920x1080，margin-x 96。\n- 顶部 rule at y=48，meta y=61。\n- 标题区 y~150-330。\n- 流程条 y~380-560。\n- 数据区 y~620-880。\n- 底部页码右下 3/6。\n\n具体：\n\n.slide padding。\n\n标题 font-size 84px，行高 1.06，颜色 ink。放在 left:96 top:150 width:1200。\n\n副标题 22px muted，top:290 左右。\n\n流程条：y=380，宽 1760，四个卡片 width 380 gap 40? 1760 - 3*40=1640 → 每个 410。用 flex，间距用箭头。简化：grid 4 列，gap 44，每列 ~ (1760-132)/4 = 407。\n\n每卡片：上方编号 01 大写小字 + 环节名 32px + 细线 + 简短描述？描述不能编造。只写环节名称即可，可加\"资料整理/角色分工/沟通记录/版本归档\"。描述文字需谨慎，我可以用少量非事实性的结构描述？最好避免编造。可以在卡片下加\"待补充\"？不。就写编号+名称，下方一条细线和小字\"环节 01/04\"？简洁即可。\n\n我可以在每个卡片加一个\"· 环节\"标签，保持视觉平衡。可以适当加横线空格作为占位装饰。\n\n数据区：\n左侧标题\"中部核验记录\"（小字大写字距），两张大卡：13 流程节点、7 复盘会议。数字 96px 衬线。\n右侧卡片：\"联系人 · 时间安排 —— 资料未载\"：两个字段行，标签\"负责人姓名\"→ 值\"资料未载\"，标签\"时间安排\"→\"资料未载\"；下方说明：\"资料未记载各环节负责人姓名与时间安排，故留空。\"\n\n注意：要点里说\"资料未记载各环节负责人姓名与时间安排，故留空\"，这与\"资料未载\"一致。\n\n右下角页码 \"3 / 6\"。参考页页码在左上，但任务要求右下角。遵守任务要求。\n\n配色变量。\n\n现在写 HTML。\n\n背景装饰：radial gradients、竖线（4条）、右上环形 register（部分超出）、右下角点阵。注意 overflow hidden。\n\n写：\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\n:root{ --bg:#F5F2E9; ... }\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F2E9;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;}\n.slide{position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:...;font-family:\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:#1B2620;}\n```\n\n字体：中文用系统中文字体；标题衬线用 Georgia,\"Songti SC\",\"SimSun\",serif — 但中文衬线可能渲染成宋体，看起来庄重，可以。标题用 serif 也许好看。参考页用 Bodoni Moda 衬线大标题。中文用 \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\" 回退。可能在某些环境显示宋体。可接受。我用 font-family: Georgia, \"Songti SC\", \"STSong\", \"SimSun\", serif 用于大标题。\n\n开始构造细节：\n\n背景：\n```\n.bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:\n radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%, rgba(180,145,74,.09), transparent 70%),\n radial-gradient(900px 760px at 48% 50%, rgba(140,159,178,.10),